{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_About.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Potat</strong> is a quirky, physics-based 3D adventure where you play as a sentient potato trying to escape a house before you get cooked alive. Roll, flip, and flop your way through a bizarre home filled with deadly traps, chaotic layouts, and unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? Make it out of the house, reach the backyard, bury yourself in the soil, and fulfill your true destiny: becoming a full-fledged potato plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The root of all chaos starts with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_Adventure-Packed.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on a wild adventure by rolling through the house, flipping over tight spaces, and finding creative ways to navigate areas too small for a normal escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_Adventure-Packed.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_ChaoticHouse.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whoever placed objects in this house clearly wasn\u2019t thinking straight! Use the bizarre layout to your advantage\u2014navigate through the chaotic layout to escape and be reborn outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_HouseLayout.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_Hazard.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyday household items are a nightmare for our sentient potato. From sharp knives to bouncy sponges, dodge dangerous obstacles and move with care\u2014one wrong step and you\u2019re mashed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_Hazard.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611540?t=1744628782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611540?t=1744628782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/371570d15edf2451202f04aa55101f2152e20d44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744628782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/371570d15edf2451202f04aa55101f2152e20d44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744628782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3612830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_About.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Potat</strong> is a quirky, physics-based 3D adventure where you play as a sentient potato trying to escape a house before you get cooked alive. Roll, flip, and flop your way through a bizarre home filled with deadly traps, chaotic layouts, and unexpected obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal? Make it out of the house, reach the backyard, bury yourself in the soil, and fulfill your true destiny: becoming a full-fledged potato plant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The root of all chaos starts with you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_Adventure-Packed.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on a wild adventure by rolling through the house, flipping over tight spaces, and finding creative ways to navigate areas too small for a normal escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_Adventure-Packed.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_ChaoticHouse.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whoever placed objects in this house clearly wasn\u2019t thinking straight! Use the bizarre layout to your advantage\u2014navigate through the chaotic layout to escape and be reborn outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_HouseLayout.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Description_Hazard.png?t=1744628782\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyday household items are a nightmare for our sentient potato. From sharp knives to bouncy sponges, dodge dangerous obstacles and move with care\u2014one wrong step and you\u2019re mashed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611540/extras/Steam_Potat_GIF_Hazard.gif?t=1744628782\" /></p>","developers":["Hexe Circles"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https:/